<title>SOUTH AFRICA: METAIR CAUTIONS ON POSSIBLE TRANSACTION.</title>
<headline>METAIR CAUTIONS ON POSSIBLE TRANSACTION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metair Investments Ltd said on Friday it was at a preliminary stage of investigating the potential of a possible transaction.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution when dealing in Metair's shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
